      "id": "claim_853c11667b374aeb851b1b58ab983c96",
      "statement": "deploy.sh requires MYFEEDER_PG_PASSWORD and MYFEEDER_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (script fails under set -u if unset), while MYFEEDER_RAINDROP_API_TOKEN and MYFEEDER_TYPESAFE_API_KEY are optional and each prints a warning when unset (Raindrop disabled / interest scoring disabled) without aborting the deploy.",
