      "id": "claim_ba7151d58ee24a4cbf87083d4839befc",
      "statement": "InterestScoringSweep runs on a fixedDelay of myfeeder.interest.sweep-delay (default PT2M) after sweep-initial-delay (PT1M) and enqueues up to min(free queue room, sweep-batch-size=50) eligible articles per run, skipping runs when Jev is unconfigured, in cold start, or the jev circuit breaker is OPEN/FORCED_OPEN.",
