    {
      "id": "claim_401f78368e324ff4943ae52179d0dbe8",
      "statement": "The committed throttle levers for the interest-scoring sweep are myfeeder.interest.sweep-batch-size and myfeeder.interest.sweep-delay in application.yaml (requiring a normal release), while the emergency lever is `kubectl -n myfeeder set env deploy/myfeeder MYFEEDER_INTEREST_SWEEPBATCHSIZE=<n>`, which restarts the pod immediately without a release.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://CLAUDE.md#L242-L242",
