    {
      "id": "claim_11bb557478724d0b8b0fe67b68fffdcf",
      "statement": "After a tuned sweep-batch-size value lands in application.yaml via a release, the out-of-band `kubectl set env ... MYFEEDER_INTEREST_SWEEPBATCHSIZE-` removal step is required because a Helm upgrade's three-way merge can leave a previously-set, Helm-unmanaged environment variable in place, letting it keep silently overriding the committed yaml value.",
      "evidence": [
